[node name="IntroContent" type="RichTextLabel" parent="IntroPanel/IntroVBox/IntroScroll"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[color=#bbaaee][center][b]🎓 WHAT YOU'LL LEARN[/b][/center]

Welcome to the RSA Key Lab! You'll build real encryption keys
step-by-step and learn how modern cryptography actually works.

[color=#bb77ff][b]📐 PHASE 1: RSA — Learn the Math[/b][/color]
Walk through RSA key generation step by step:
1. Pick two prime numbers (p and q)
2. Compute n = p × q (the modulus)
3. Compute φ(n) = (p−1)(q−1) (Euler's totient)
4. Choose e (public exponent) — must be coprime to φ(n)
5. Compute d (private decryption key) — d × e ≡ 1 mod φ(n)
6. Encrypt and decrypt a message using your keys!

[color=#ff9933][b]🔑 Public Key = (e, n)[/b] — Anyone can encrypt with this
[b]🔒 Private Key = (d, n)[/b] — Only YOU can decrypt[/color]

[color=#bb77ff][b]🧪 PHASE 2: RSA — Practice[/b][/color]
Solve RSA problems on your own! Given primes, compute modulus,
totient, and keys. Test your understanding.

[color=#bb77ff][b]🤝 PHASE 3: Diffie-Hellman — Learn[/b][/color]
The magic of key exchange! Two people can agree on a secret
over a public channel without ever sending the key:
• Agree on public values: prime p and generator g
• Each picks a secret number
• Exchange computed public values
• Both arrive at the SAME shared secret!
[color=#ff9933]Used in: TLS/HTTPS, VPNs, Signal, WhatsApp[/color]

[color=#bb77ff][b]🔬 PHASE 4: Diffie-Hellman — Practice[/b][/color]
Compute DH values yourself. Verify both sides get the same key.

[color=#bb77ff][b]🌐 PHASE 5: Cryptography in Practice[/b][/color]
Real-world scenarios: Which protocol or technique applies?
TLS, digital signatures, certificate authorities, hybrid encryption.

[color=#ff8888]❤️ You have 3 hearts — wrong answers cost a heart!
🏆 Complete all 5 phases for maximum XP![/color]

[center][color=#88ff88][b]Small numbers are used here for learning.
Real RSA uses 2048+ bit primes![/b][/color][/center][/color]"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

