bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][color=#88ff88][b]📚 What You Learned:[/b][/color]
• RSA: Two primes → modulus → totient → public/private keys
• Encryption: m^e mod n | Decryption: c^d mod n
• Diffie-Hellman: Shared secret over public channel
• TLS uses RSA/DH for key exchange + AES for bulk encryption
• Digital signatures prove authenticity (sign with private key)[/center]"
